:"Platea di Fondazione","discipline":"Structural Foundations","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Reinforced concrete raft or foundation slab distributing loads across an extended area. Quantity is typically governed by area, thickness and volume.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":7},{"element_type_code":"FOND-004","element_type_name":"Magrone","discipline":"Structural Foundations","material":"CLS magro (NON armato, non strutturale)","default_uom":"m²","description":"Non-structural lean concrete blinding layer placed on prepared subgrade. Provides a clean, level working surface for reinforcement, formwork or foundation casting.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":8},{"element_type_code":"FOND-005","element_type_name":"Sella CLS / Capotrave","discipline":"Structural Foundations","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Large reinforced concrete cap, saddle or pedestal-type component transferring loads between upper supports and underlying foundation elements.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":9},{"element_type_code":"FOND-006","element_type_name":"Setto Verticale","discipline":"Walls","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Vertical reinforced concrete wall or shear wall providing lateral stiffness and load transfer within a foundation or structural system.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":10},{"element_type_code":"COL-001","element_type_name":"Pilastro CLS in Opera","discipline":"Structural Columns","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Cast-in-place reinforced concrete column or vertical structural member. Quantity is typically governed by volume, height, section and reinforcement.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":11},{"element_type_code":"COL-002","element_type_name":"Pilastro Prefabbricato","discipline":"Structural Columns","material":"CLS Precompresso / (c.a.v. — vibrato)","default_uom":"cad","description":"Precast reinforced or prestressed concrete column produced off site and installed on site. Connection and embedment details depend on design configuration.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":12},{"element_type_code":"COL-003","element_type_name":"Torre / Pilastro Metallico","discipline":"Structural Columns","material":"Acciaio (STL)","default_uom":"kg","description":"Steel vertical structural member, column or tower-like support. Complex assemblies may require component or assembly-level modelling.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":13},{"element_type_code":"CONN-001","element_type_name":"Appoggio strutturale / Sliding Bearing","discipline":"Structural Connections","material":"Acciaio (cuscinetto / elastomerico/PTFE)","default_uom":"cad","description":"Structural bearing or sliding support transferring loads between superstructure and substructure while allowing controlled movement or rotation.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":14},{"element_type_code":"CONN-002","element_type_name":"Baggiolo","discipline":"Structural Connections","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Small reinforced concrete support block or pedestal used below a bearing or local support component.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":15},{"element_type_code":"TRAVE-001","element_type_name":"Trave CLS in Opera","discipline":"Structural Framing","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Cast-in-place reinforced concrete beam or horizontal structural member. Quantity is typically governed by volume, length, section and reinforcement.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":16},{"element_type_code":"TRAVE-002","element_type_name":"Trave/Arcareccio Prefabbricato","discipline":"Structural Framing","material":"CLS Precompresso (c.a.p.)","default_uom":"m","description":"Precast reinforced or prestressed concrete beam, purlin or similar linear structural member. Specific subtype belongs in properties or configuration.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":17},{"element_type_code":"FRAM-001","element_type_name":"Segmento Impalcato","discipline":"Structural Framing","material":"Acciaio (STL)","default_uom":"m","description":"Steel bridge, deck or frame segment. Detailed IFC representation may require beam, member, plate or assembly-level modelling.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":18},{"element_type_code":"FRAM-002","element_type_name":"Strallo / Cavo","discipline":"Structural Framing","material":"Acciaio (cavo trefoli / ad alta resistenza)","default_uom":"m","description":"Structural stay cable, strand or high-tensile tension element. Material, anchorage and stressing requirements depend on design configuration.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":19},{"element_type_code":"PANEL-001","element_type_name":"Pannello Prefabbricato","discipline":"Walls","material":"CLS Precompresso (c.a.v.)","default_uom":"m²","description":"Precast concrete wall or cladding panel. Structural role, connection detail and facade or wall classification depend on system configuration.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":20},{"element_type_code":"SLAB-001","element_type_name":"Solaio / lastra prefabbricata in CLS","discipline":"Floors","material":"CLS prefabbricato / precompresso","default_uom":"m²","description":"Generic precast or prestressed concrete slab, TT unit, roof/floor slab or deck unit. Main method: off-site production and installation.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":21},{"element_type_code":"SLAB-002","element_type_name":"Soletta / topping CLS in opera","discipline":"Floors","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Generic reinforced concrete slab, topping, or cast-in-place deck/soletta. Main method: formwork, reinforcement and concrete pour.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":22},{"element_type_code":"SLAB-003","element_type_name":"Lamiera grecata / deck metallico","discipline":"Floors","material":"Acciaio / lamiera profilata","default_uom":"m²","description":"Generic steel/profiled metal deck or sheet. Main method: steel or metal deck supply and installation.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":23},{"element_type_code":"WALL-001","element_type_name":"Parete CLS in Opera","discipline":"Walls","material":"CLS armato","default_uom":"m³","description":"Cast-in-place reinforced concrete wall. May act as structural wall, retaining wall or vertical enclosure depending on design context.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":24},{"element_type_code":"FLOOR-001","element_type_name":"Pavimento Industriale","discipline":"Floors","material":"CLS armato + Rete elettrosaldata + Spolvero quarzo","default_uom":"m²","description":"Industrial floor slab or ground-bearing slab, typically reinforced and finished for service loads. Surface finish and jointing requirements belong in specifications.","status":"PROPOSED","source_row":25}]$m18$::jsonb) AS src(
